ching a notebook tutorial creates a workbench in the user's project with the tutorial notebook available and running (validates the Notebooks component keeps working with no code changes on it — passive component)\n47\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial imports the pipeline into the user's project's Data Science Pipelines application (validates the Data Science Pipelines component keeps working with no code changes on it — passive component)\n48\t- Gallery rendering and both launch paths are verified end-to-end against at least one tutorial packaged per the tutorial packaging format\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- HLR-1 (P0, primary): Dashboard tutorial gallery with one-click launch into the user's project\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b228d5d8c46820f5","agent_id":"a632e6c796703ddb2","session_id":"0ad94842-2610-4147-8d08-4293ba16f19d","uuid":"b53b2d50-c0f9-4845-bcb5-d54788b0e83e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T20:01:47.174Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-980565c484e934e1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
